+
+/* The emoticon panel under a chat feed: one tab per pack, a grid of
+ * emoticons, and a line that names the one under the pointer (tooltips
+ * would be separate windows, which cannot show over another app's full-
+ * screen Space). It lives inside the chat window rather than in a pop-up
+ * for the same reason. Nothing in it takes keyboard focus, so typing in the
+ * send box goes on. Inline emoji are inserted as text; stickers are sent. */
+class EmojiPicker : public QWidget {
